      "claim_id": "ibm_opening",
      "claim_kind": "NUMBER",
      "claim_text": "SINGLE-SOURCE REPORT - REUTERS: Does IBM's reported software upgrade show lasting demand, or business arriving after a delay? Reuters' October 21, 2026 report attributes to Kavanaugh an annual software revenue growth outlook of about 7% to 8%, previously 6% to 8%; the underlying update has not been independently confirmed. Those reported ranges lift the floor and retain an 8% ceiling. If the report is accurate, Capital Chronicle's reading is greater confidence in the bottom of the range, while a faster upper-end growth path remains unestablished.",
