      "claim_text": "The deal-mix detail has a narrower denominator. Reuters attributes to Kavanaugh a breakdown of transaction-processing revenue: about 25% came from business deferred from the second quarter, with the other 75% characterized as net new business. Those shares refer to that revenue category; they are neither a split of all IBM revenue nor a decomposition of software revenue growth.",
