      "claim_kind": "CAUSALITY",
      "claim_text": "If the report is accurate, business delayed from an earlier quarter could support the current result without proving a lasting rise in demand. Capital Chronicle's timing test is whether fresh business keeps arriving after that catch-up fades.",
